-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ב': the work-week tables of a teacher
-- entitled to the full reduction of hours for age, under the reform in full
-- (§12 sends to it): one from 50 to 55, one over 55; the 60-minute hour of
-- their presence; their notes on frontal hours that are not whole and on
-- too few.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`

§ `נספח ב'`

-- The title ("טבלאות שבוע עבודה למורים הזכאים להפחתת שעות בשל גיל ביישום
-- מלא של הרפורמה"), the caption "מורה מגיל 50 ועד גיל 55" and its table:
-- from the full position less the age reduction — §9(ו)'s week with 2
-- frontal hours off, 22 frontal, 6 individual and 10 teaching-support hours
-- — down to 4 frontal hours, a frontal hour less a column.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p1 akn:att_5__hc_1/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1/t1
`the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ב'"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 22 6 10 38,
            `an Oz annexed column` (96.05%) 21 6 9.5 36.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (90.79%) 20 5.5 9 34.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (85.53%) 19 5 8.5 32.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (81.58%) 18 5 8 31,
            `an Oz annexed column` (76.32%) 17 4.5 7.5 29,
            `an Oz annexed column` (72.37%) 16 4.5 7 27.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (68.42%) 15 4 7 26,
            `an Oz annexed column` (64.47%) 14 4 6.5 24.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (59.21%) 13 3.5 6 22.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (53.95%) 12 3 5.5 20.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 11 3 5 19,
            `an Oz annexed column` (46.05%) 10 3 4.5 17.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (40.79%) 9 2.5 4 15.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (35.53%) 8 2 3.5 13.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (31.58%) 7 2 3 12,
            `an Oz annexed column` (26.32%) 6 1.5 2.5 10,
            `an Oz annexed column` (23.68%) 5 1.5 2.5 9,
            `an Oz annexed column` (18.42%) 4 1 2 7

-- "מורה מעל גיל 55" and its table: §9(ו)'s week with 4 frontal hours off,
-- 20 frontal, 6 individual and 10 teaching-support hours, down to 4.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1/t2
`the table of annex ב' over 55` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ב'"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band over 55`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 20 6 10 36,
            `an Oz annexed column` (95.83%) 19 6 9.5 34.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (90.28%) 18 5.5 9 32.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (84.72%) 17 5 8.5 30.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (80.56%) 16 5 8 29,
            `an Oz annexed column` (75.00%) 15 4.5 7.5 27,
            `an Oz annexed column` (69.44%) 14 4 7 25,
            `an Oz annexed column` (65.28%) 13 4 6.5 23.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (59.72%) 12 3.5 6 21.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (54.17%) 11 3 5.5 19.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 10 3 5 18,
            `an Oz annexed column` (44.44%) 9 3 4 16,
            `an Oz annexed column` (40.28%) 8 2.5 4 14.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (34.72%) 7 2 3.5 12.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (30.56%) 6 2 3 11,
            `an Oz annexed column` (25.00%) 5 1.5 2.5 9,
            `an Oz annexed column` (19.44%) 4 1 2 7

-- The table for a teacher's band; the annex has none under 50.
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed table`
DECIDE `the table of annex ב' for` band IS
    CONSIDER band
    WHEN `the Oz band from 50 to 55` THEN JUST `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55`
    WHEN `the Oz band over 55`       THEN JUST `the table of annex ב' over 55`
    WHEN `the Oz band under 50`      THEN NOTHING

-- The asterisk under each table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§9(יא)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching
-- period as the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1/p5
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex ב' asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex ב' changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The first note: frontal and role hours that are not whole take the
-- individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and the
-- position is all the hours over the full position's (common: `the week
-- the annexed table gives`, `the position of the week in the annexed
-- table`) — the full position of the teacher's own table, as
-- F-oz-founding-annex-b-a reads "בסיס המשרה".
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p6
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what the tables of annex ב' give for` band f IS
    CONSIDER `the table of annex ב' for` band
    WHEN JUST t THEN `what the annexed table gives for` t f
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- The second note: a teacher with fewer than 4 frontal hours (with his
-- homeroom and role hours) works frontal hours only, his position his
-- hours over "בסיס המשרה ברפורמה". "בפחות מ-4" leaves 4
-- out; each table's last column is 4. Which base the note means is
-- F-oz-founding-annex-b-a's: the table's own full position.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p7
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the fewest frontal hours annex ב' keeps whole for` band IS
    IF band EQUALS `the Oz band over 55` THEN 4 ELSE 4

GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put him in
      f IS A NUMBER @desc frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex ב' gives a teacher with` band f IS
    CONSIDER `the table of annex ב' for` band
    WHEN JUST t THEN `what the annexed table gives, frontal hours only below` t (`the fewest frontal hours annex ב' keeps whole for` band) f
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `נספח ב' -- the checks`

-- Each table opens at the full position and steps down a frontal hour at a
-- time, to the last column the second note keeps whole.
#ASSERT `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` AND `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ב' over 55`
#ASSERT `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` AND `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ב' over 55`
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` EQUALS `the fewest frontal hours annex ב' keeps whole for` `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ב' over 55` EQUALS `the fewest frontal hours annex ב' keeps whole for` `the Oz band over 55`

-- Their arithmetic holds in every cell: each presence is its column's
-- hours, each position its hours over the table's full position (38 hours
-- from 50 to 55, 36 over 55).
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ב' over 55` EQUALS EMPTY

-- F-oz-founding-annex-b-a: the notes divide by "בסיס המשרה" (the first)
-- and "בסיס המשרה ברפורמה" (the second), which §9(א) sets at 40 hours,
-- while every position the tables print is a share of the teacher's own
-- full position, 38 or 36 hours. Read on 40, the first note would put 20.5
-- frontal hours from 50 to 55 (the column of 21: 36 hours) at 90%, below
-- the 90.79% the table prints for 20; read on the table's 38, at 94.74%,
-- between 20's and 21's. The reading adopted: the table's own full
-- position (convention reading.consistent).
`annex ב's notes divide by a base its tables are not drawn on` MEANS
        `the full position's hours in the annexed table` `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` EQUALS 38
    AND `the full position's hours in the annexed table` `the table of annex ב' over 55` EQUALS 36
    AND `the Oz position base` EQUALS 40
    AND (20.5 + 6 + 9.5) DIVIDED BY `the Oz position base` LESS THAN (90.79%)
    AND `what annex ב' gives a teacher with` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 20.5
            EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 20.5 6 9.5) (36 DIVIDED BY 38) (36 DIVIDED BY 38))
#ASSERT `annex ב's notes divide by a base its tables are not drawn on`

§§ `נספח ב' -- illustrations`

-- From 50 to 55, 21 frontal hours: 36.5 hours of 38, 96.05%; over 55, 3
-- frontal hours: frontal hours only, 3 of 36; under 50 the annex has no
-- table.
#ASSERT `what annex ב' gives a teacher with` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 21 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 21 6 9.5) (96.05%) (96.05%))
#ASSERT `what annex ב' gives a teacher with` `the Oz band over 55` 3 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 3 0 0) (3 DIVIDED BY 36) (3 DIVIDED BY 36))
#ASSERT `what annex ב' gives a teacher with` `the Oz band under 50` 21 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex ב' changes the length of a teaching period`
